5. Wrapped the component in a div with padding for better visibility
6. Added a more informative error message component

The key improvements are:
- No more dependency on jest
- Proper mocking of TRPC functionality
- Better error handling and user feedback
- More complete mock implementation of TRPC methods

This should resolve the "jest is not defined" error and provide a better foundation for the component to render properly. If you see any other specific errors after this change, please let me know and I can help adjust the solution further.

